      timeline.innerHTML=`<h3>Reported filing references</h3><p>A filing mention does not establish a meeting, contact, endorsement or position. Quarters below use filing dates; they are not contact dates.</p><div class="ml-research-controls"><button data-quarter="" aria-pressed="${!quarter}">All filing dates · ${rows.length}</button>${quarters.map(q=>`<button data-quarter="${esc(q)}" aria-pressed="${q===quarter}">${esc(q)} · ${rows.filter(r=>r.quarter===q).length}</button>`).join('')}</div>${table(['Filing date','Organization','Cited bill','Source excerpt'],shown.map(r=>[esc(r.date),esc(r.org),esc(r.bill),esc(r.note)]),`${visible.length} reported filing references · ${shown.length} shown · page ${page+1} of ${Math.max(1,Math.ceil(visible.length/50))}`)}<div class="ml-pagination"><button data-ledger-page="prev" ${page===0?'disabled':''}>Previous 50</button><button data-ledger-page="next" ${(page+1)*50>=visible.length?'disabled':''}>Next 50</button></div><details class="ml-record"><summary>Reading this ledger</summary><p>Organization and bill membership describe the reported filing. Position inference remains labeled in the original source detail; missing positions are unknown.</p></details>`;
